{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"authenticate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor7RequestC","text":"Request"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor8ResponseC","text":"Response"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The authorization endpoint is used to interact with the resource"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owner and obtain an authorization grant.  The authorization server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"MUST first verify the identity of the resource owner.  The way in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which the authorization server authenticates the resource owner"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g., username and password login, session cookies) is beyond the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scope of this specification."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, the client directs the user-agent to make the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HTTP request using TLS:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CURL request:"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"code":["curl \"https:\/\/example.com\/api\/v1\/oauth\/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=s6BhdRkqt3&state=xyz&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fclient%2Eexample%2Ecom%2Fcb\" \\","-X GET"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After that request user is redirected to login page (it it’s not already signed in)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or to authorization page. After authorization redirection to specified "},{"code":"redirect_uri","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is done (with "},{"code":"code","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" which can be replaced for the access token in token endpoint)."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/vernissageserver\/oauthcontroller\/authenticate(request:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/OAuthController\/authenticate(request:)"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/OAuthController"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"authenticate(request:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"authenticate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor7RequestC","text":"Request"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor8ResponseC","text":"Response"}],"externalID":"s:16VernissageServer15OAuthControllerV12authenticate7request5Vapor8ResponseCAF7RequestC_tYaYbKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Vernissage"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Authorization endpoint - used by the client to obtain authorization from"},{"ty